## 9. Android WebView 集成建议

Wendi Android 首版只需要加载移动端 URL：

```kotlin
webView.loadUrl("https://picoclaw-mobile.company.com/mobile")
```

推荐设置：

```kotlin
webView.settings.javaScriptEnabled = true
webView.settings.domStorageEnabled = true
webView.settings.mixedContentMode = WebSettings.MIXED_CONTENT_NEVER_ALLOW

CookieManager.getInstance().setAcceptCookie(true)
CookieManager.getInstance().setAcceptThirdPartyCookies(webView, false)
```

推荐限制导航：

```kotlin
override fun shouldOverrideUrlLoading(
    view: WebView,
    request: WebResourceRequest,
): Boolean {
    val host = request.url.host ?: return true
    return host != "picoclaw-mobile.company.com"
}
```

首版不要使用 `addJavascriptInterface`。H5 页面已经可以靠同源 cookie、HTTP API 和 WebSocket 完成聊天。

